Package: openpbr
Type: Package
Title: 'OpenPBR' Surface Shading Headers
Version: 1.1.1-0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tyler", "Morgan-Wall", email = "tylermw@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3131-3814")),
    person("Adobe", role = c("aut", "cph"),
        comment = "OpenPBR BSDF implementation"))
Description: Provides the header-only 'C++' implementation of the 'OpenPBR'
    surface shading model for physically based rendering
    <https://academysoftwarefoundation.github.io/OpenPBR/>. Combines diffuse
    reflection, metals, transparent dielectrics, coatings, fuzz, and
    subsurface scattering in a layered material model. Includes scattering
    evaluation and importance sampling.
